=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T16:52:13Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T16:52:44Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.4.beta3 (macOS 15.2, MacBook 16\" 2024 with Apple M4 Max 40-core GPU).\n\nThis only occurs in fullscreen though, not when the window is at regular or maximized size. This is most noticeable in 2D demos, but 3D demos like Truck Town exhibit the issue too.\n\nDoes this happen on other games not using Godot on macOS? I'm not sure if this can be fixed if this is an issue that affects the entire OS. It's likely that the FPS drops occur due to the fullscreen mode not being designed to show overlays like volume/brightness, and macOS falling back to a less optimized mode while the overlay is visible.\n\ncc @bruvzg ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657199564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657237214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102761#issuecomment-2657237214","issue_url":"https://api.g